        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alexander Hall, Jon Amiel, Ida Lupino\n- Roles: film director, theatre actor\n- Places: Boston, Massachusetts; San Francisco, California; UK; US\n- Works: Yours for the Asking\n\nFacts:\n- Alexander Hall was born on January 11, 1894, in Boston, Massachusetts.\n- Alexander Hall was an American film director and theatre actor.\n- Jon Amiel was born on 20 May 1948.\n- Jon Amiel is an English film director.\n- Since the early 1980s, Jon Amiel has worked in film and television in both the UK and the US.\n- The film Yours for the Asking was directed by Alexander Hall.\n- The film Yours for the Asking also features Ida Lupino.\n- Alexander Hall died on July 30, 1968, in San Francisco, California.",
